  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.152,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "现在好多人都在讲嘛，每逢佳节都胖三斤。",
      "score": 0.1637,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1036,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1412,
        "sc_delta": -0.0377,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.056,
        "seg_cer": 0.294,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "现在好多人不得奖吗？每逢佳节，这胖三斤。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.197,
      "end": 7.782,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这一句话不光是形容讲是在节假日里面吃的多啊导致体重上升。",
      "score": 0.0169,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0446,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0437,
        "sc_delta": 0.0008,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.037,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这一句话不光是形容，讲是在节假日里面吃得多啊，导致体重上升。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 7.954,
      "end": 12.412,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "那么其实这种平时生活当中啊也会出现饮食失控的情况。",
      "score": 0.1745,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1568,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1732,
        "sc_delta": -0.0164,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.152,
        "seg_cer": 0.208,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那么，其实在我们平时生活当中啊，也会出现因时失控的情况。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 12.474,
      "end": 14.94,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "那啷子才能够避免胖三斤呢？",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0147,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0128,
        "sc_delta": 0.0019,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那啷子才能够避免胖三斤呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.94,
      "end": 19.575,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "今天我们通过我们的编辑来分析一下。有分有素，减杂炖煮，",
      "score": 0.7081,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9725,
        "sc_logprob": -0.9869,
        "sc_delta": -0.0144,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.143,
        "phon_examples": "煮/组",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今天我听下我们的编辑来分析一下：有分有速，检查灯组。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.575,
      "end": 22.124,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "饮料水果啷子吃才健康？",
      "score": 0.0457,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.053,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0543,
        "sc_delta": -0.0012,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.1,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "饮料水果，浪子吃才健康。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 22.416,
      "end": 25.619,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "应该控制好摄入的总热量和食物种类。",
      "score": 0.169,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0064,
        "sc_logprob": -0.007,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
